<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB 1996 net profit declines.</title>
<headline>ABB 1996 net profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996 vs 1995</p>
<p>				     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	  1,233		  vs 1,315</p>
<p>Operating earnings</p>
<p> after depreciation	3,026		  vs 3,275</p>
<p> New orders received     36,349		 vs 36,224</p>
<p> Order backlog end-year  33,400		 vs 33,500</p>
<p> Income before taxes     2,007		  vs 2,110</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG. Analysts had forecast $1.30 billion 1996 net profit. ABB said 1996 net income rose 15.8 pct when excluding $250 million 1995 extraordinary gain.</p>
<p> Net before minorities   1,242		  vs 1,361</p>
<p> Minorities		  9			vs 46</p>
<p> Taxes			 765		    vs 749</p>
