<p> Personnel expenses	10,254		 vs 10,246</p>
<p> Unusual items	     36		     vs 246</p>
<p>Earnings from equity</p>
<p> accounted companies     6			vs 12</p>
<p> Interest income	   362		    vs 509</p>
<p> Interest on advances    807		    vs 987</p>
